sequenceDiagram
    participant ODH as opendatahub-operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AGO as ai-gateway-operator
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>odh-aigateway-config
    participant BGO as batch-gateway-operator
    participant MaaS as maas-controller

    Note over ODH,MaaS: Flow 1: Sub-Component Deployment (Batch Gateway)
    ODH->>K8s: Create AIGateway CR<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8s-->>AGO: Watch event: AIGateway CR<br/>batchGateway.managementState=Managed
    AGO->>K8s: Render kustomize + SSA<br/>Deployments, CRDs, RBAC<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8s-->>BGO: Deployment created
    BGO->>K8s: Watch LLMBatchGateway CRs<br/>Auth: SA Token

    Note over ODH,MaaS: Flow 2: MaaS Controller Deployment & Teardown
    ODH->>K8s: Update AIGateway CR<br/>modelsAsAService.managementState=Managed
    K8s-->>AGO: Watch event: AIGateway CR
    AGO->>K8s: Create infra namespace<br/>+ RBAC for secret migration<br/>Auth: SA Token
    AGO->>K8s: Render maascontroller manifests<br/>SSA Deployment, CRDs, webhook<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8s-->>MaaS: Deployment created
    MaaS->>K8s: Watch MaaS CRDs<br/>Create HTTPRoute, AuthPolicy<br/>Auth: SA Token

    Note over AGO,MaaS: Teardown Protocol
    AGO->>K8s: Set teardown-requested annotation<br/>on maas-controller Deployment
    K8s-->>MaaS: Annotation update received
    MaaS->>MaaS: Disable self-heal<br/>Delete Config/default<br/>Clean up runtime resources
    MaaS->>K8s: Set teardown-completed annotation<br/>on own Deployment
    K8s-->>AGO: Annotation update received
    AGO->>K8s: GC delete MaaS resources<br/>(maasAwareGCPredicate allows)

    Note over ODH,AGO: Flow 3: Platform Version Upgrade Handshake
    ODH->>K8s: Write platformVersion to<br/>odh-aigateway-config ConfigMap
    K8s-->>CM: ConfigMap updated
    AGO->>CM: Read platformVersion
    AGO->>K8s: Write platform version to<br/>AIGateway CR status.releases
    ODH->>K8s: Read AIGateway CR status.releases<br/>Detect version alignment
